Fix your code like this:

```ts
const result = await generateText({
  model: yourModel,
  allowSystemInMessages: true, // Add this
  messages: [
    { role: 'system', content: 'Your system message from DB' },
    ...otherMessages,
  ],
});
```

Alternatively, you can move the system instruction to the `instructions` property instead of including it in the messages array [1]:

```ts
const result = await generateText({
  model: yourModel,
  instructions: 'Your system message from DB', // Use instructions instead
  messages: [...otherMessages],
});
```

